## Anserini Prebuilt Index Evaluator — Complete ✅

### Architecture

```
anserini-evaluator/
├── package.json              # Express + Playwright deps
├── server.js                 # Express backend (Node.js)
├── public/
│   └── index.html            # Single-page frontend (vanilla JS)
├── playwright.config.js      # Playwright E2E config
├── tests/
│   └── evaluator.spec.js     # 7 E2E tests
├── anserini-2.1.1-fatjar.jar # Anserini CLI
└── runs/                     # Generated run & eval files
```

### What each piece does

**`server.js`** (Express backend):
- **Fatjar discovery**: Searches the workspace directory first, then parent dirs, then system — no hardcoded single path
- `GET /api/status` — Java version, jar path, evaluable pairings
- `GET /api/indexes` — calls `io.anserini.cli.PrebuiltIndexRegistry --list` (272 real indexes), annotates each with evaluability
- `POST /api/evaluate` — spawns `SearchCollection` (BM25 retrieval → TREC run file) then `TrecEval` (score), returns timestamped artifacts
- `GET /runs/:file` — serves generated run/eval files

**`public/index.html`** (single-page frontend):
- **Left panel**: Searchable/filterable catalog of all 272 prebuilt indexes from the registry, with type filter (inverted/flat/hnsw/impact) and evaluability filter; each row shows name, description, type badge, and Evaluable/Catalog badge
- **Right panel**: CACM auto-selected on load; shows topic/qrels pairing (topics=`cacm`, qrels=`cacm`); metric pills for nDCG@10, Recall@1000, MAP, P@30; Run button; progress indicator; score display; full metadata card; evaluator output preview

**`tests/evaluator.spec.js`** (Playwright E2E):
| Test | Verifies |
|------|----------|
| App loads catalog | 272 indexes visible — registry-derived, not hardcoded |
| CACM auto-selected | `cacm` shown as selected, topics/qrels visible, Run button enabled |
| CACM pairing | Topics and qrels non-empty, nDCG@10 + Recall@1000 metric pills present |
| Catalog-only indexes | 271 non-evaluable indexes visible |
| Search filter | "msmarco" narrows 272 → 61 rows |
| End-to-end evaluation | Real nDCG@10 score `0.4543` from actual TrecEval — test fails on mocked data |
| Run metadata | Timestamped run/eval file paths, index/topics/metric metadata, evaluator output |

### Test results
```
7 passed in 16.3 s
Score: 0.4543  (CACM nDCG@10, BM25 — matches expected Anserini value)
